Description: Overlay Studio for Wowza Streaming Engine
 Captures a web page with headless Chrome and composites it onto live streams in the
 Wowza Streaming Engine transcoder. Adds the module to /usr/local/WowzaStreamingEngine and
 sets up the capture service WowzaOverlayStudioCapture (system user wse-overlay-studio, Chrome for
 Testing downloaded during the install into /opt/wse-overlay-studio).
